//彼女は、窺うような眼差しをこちらへ向けていた。
  I know it's rude to talk while walking, but I can't just stop in the middle of the street.

  The captain is regarding me with some apprehension. Her double bass is slung over her shoulder, but its presumably prodigious weight appears to pose no burden for her.

