"Everyone talks shit about Rokuhara, but there's no one who'll actually stand up to them. I was the same. The most I could do was cause a little trouble here and there."

pt:
//【一条】
<voice name='一条' class='一条' src='voice/ma03/0071170a02'>
//「六波羅の野郎共に陰で文句を並べるだけの
//奴ならどこにだっている。でも、立ち向かう
//人はどこにもいない。あたしだってそうです。
//せこい嫌がらせをするのがせいぜいだった」
"Todo mundo fala merda do Rokuhara, mas não tem ninguém que realmente os enfrente. Eu era igual. O máximo que eu conseguia era arrumar uma encrenquinha aqui e ali."

en:
//【一条】
<voice name='一条' class='一条' src='voice/ma03/0071180a02'>
//「あなたが初めてなんです。口だけじゃない、
//奴らと戦える人は！
